      "start_seconds": 1.11,
      "end_seconds": 10.05,
      "duration_seconds": 8.94,
      "text": "Okay, um, so so hello doctor, sorry, I took a wrong turn on the way here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.79,
      "end_seconds": 16.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 17.58,
      "end_seconds": 24.89,
      "duration_seconds": 7.31,
      "text": "sorry, what was I saying, hello, doctor. I'm here with them in case I can help"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.28,
      "end_seconds": 30.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "Okay, good, that'll be useful. Pull up a chair."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.5,
      "end_seconds": 40.74,
      "duration_seconds": 6.24,
      "text": "so the thing is, I've got the worst headache of my life"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.39,
      "end_seconds": 45.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.9,
      "end_seconds": 56.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Okay keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.12,
      "end_seconds": 83.37,
      "duration_seconds": 11.25,
      "text": "okay: BP is 168 over 99, heart rate 93, respiratory rate 15. And temperature is 37.0 degrees. Can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.91,
      "end_seconds": 87.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "it's been ten days I'm fairly sure"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.03,
      "end_seconds": 90.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "how often do you get it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.61,
      "end_seconds": 99.45,
      "duration_seconds": 6.84,
      "text": "it's all the time. And there's vomiting as well, about four days now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.1,
      "end_seconds": 102.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Any a stiff neck as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.47,
      "end_seconds": 114.46,
      "duration_seconds": 9.99,
      "text": "Yeah. Two weeks, I'd say. Oh, about stiff neck, maybe a five out of ten on a bad day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.21,
      "end_seconds": 119.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "A few quick ones: fever, head injury or weakness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.06,
      "end_seconds": 123.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Right no I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.25,
      "end_seconds": 128.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "mm, okay anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.77,
      "end_seconds": 132.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "no skin's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.37,
      "end_seconds": 145.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "Alright, anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.83,
      "end_seconds": 152.75,
      "duration_seconds": 6.92,
      "text": "right I have high blood pressure i told my wife I'd come today"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.8,
      "end_seconds": 161.35,
      "duration_seconds": 7.55,
      "text": "yes okay, I can see high blood pressure in your file as well what's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.65,
      "end_seconds": 169.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "I'm on hydrochlorothiazide, 12.5 milligrams, every morning"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.96,
      "end_seconds": 172.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "And for how long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.91,
      "end_seconds": 176.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "for about a month"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.7,
      "end_seconds": 181.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "let's talk a little about your daily life and habits"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.27,
      "end_seconds": 194.76,
      "duration_seconds": 11.49,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop. I look after my grandchildren most days. I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.34,
      "end_seconds": 199.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.02,
      "end_seconds": 205.81,
      "duration_seconds": 5.79,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, no, nothing as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.36,
      "end_seconds": 212.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a a second make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 226.6,
      "end_seconds": 227.54,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "that's alright"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.38,
      "end_seconds": 230.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "raise your arm for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.34,
      "end_seconds": 250.54,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "your neck is stiff and you are very sensitive to light"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.39,
      "end_seconds": 257.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "You can relax now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.63,
      "end_seconds": 283.14,
      "duration_seconds": 12.51,
      "text": "right, here's what I'm thinking i think we're dealing with a possible bleed around the brain at this stage a migraine is also on my list"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 284.55,
      "end_seconds": 287.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "yeah will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.21,
      "end_seconds": 307.35,
      "duration_seconds": 18.14,
      "text": "I understand the worry at the moment I'd say it's a possible bleed around the brain and we'll watch how it goes i don't need to add any tests or treatment at this point right anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 312.51,
      "end_seconds": 314.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "thank you, doctor, goodbye"
    }
  ]
